BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Après-Ski Holiday Pop-Up at Newport Vineyards
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260104
DTSTAMP:20261124T205212Z
UID:e84f2496144095219c7b5cf7b601@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Newport Vineyards Après-Ski Holiday Pop-Up November 20 &#8211
 \; January 3 | Farm &amp\; Barrel Bistro Lodge Dining &amp\; Holiday Marke
 tplace Hours Sunday: 10:00 AM &#8211\; 5:00 PM (Brunch 10:00 AM &#8211\; 1
 :00 PM) Monday: 11:00 AM &#8211\; 5:00 PM Tuesday &#8211\; Saturday: 11:00
  AM &#8211\; 8:00 PM *Listed above is the last seating start time. Step ou
 t of the New England winter and into a rustic alpine lodge right here at t
 he vineyard. We’re transforming our Farm &amp\; Barrel Bistro dining roo
 m into a winter wonderland with vintage touches\, twinkling lights\, and s
 now-dusted evergreens. Did it snow a little indoors\, too? Come see for yo
 urself! ❄️ Feast on hearty dishes by the fire and sip seasonal drinks 
 like Cranberry Orange Hot Toddies and Black Diamond Espresso Martinis. The
 n browse our expanded marketplace for artisanal gifts and wine accessories
 . Après-ski attire is strongly encouraged\, so break out your winter gear
  and grab a photo at our vintage gondola! 🚡 Reservations are strongly s
 uggested\; walk-ins are welcome based on availability. The Weekly Trailsid
 e Lineup: The lodge is open for dining all day\, every day (see hours abov
 e). Times listed below are for each day’s special. Sundays: Alpine Brunc
 h &amp\; Holiday Shopping. Brunch with live acoustic music in the lodge fr
 om 10:30 AM &#8211\; 1:30 PM. Then head downstairs to the taproom (11:00 A
 M &#8211\; 4:00 PM) for guided tours and wine pours\, and shop the marketp
 lace for holiday gifts until 5:00 PM. 🎁 Mondays: Lunch by the Fire. A r
 elaxing midday break with a winter cocktail in hand. Tuesdays: Half-Price 
 Bottles. 50% off bottles of wine with an entrée purchase\, 4:00 &#8211\; 
 8:00 PM. Wednesdays: Trivia &amp\; Flights. $15 wine and beer flights all 
 day\, plus trivia from 6:00 &#8211\; 8:00 PM. (no trivia December 23) Thur
 sdays: Locals &amp\; Industry Night. From 4:00 &#8211\; 8:00 PM\, show a l
 ocal ID or proof of industry employment for a complimentary glass of wine 
 or beer with your entrée. Fireside Fridays. Dinner from 4:00 &#8211\; 8:0
 0 PM with live acoustic music and tableside s’mores. (Starts Nov 27\, ru
 ns through Jan 1. No dining room music on December 11 due to our Christmas
  Extravaganza downstairs.) Saturdays: Alpine Weekend Escape &amp\; Holiday
  Shopping. Dine in the lodge\, then head downstairs to the taproom (11:00 
 AM &#8211\; 5:00 PM) for flights\, après-ski cocktails\, hot cocoa\, cook
 ies\, and our Charcuterie Cart (12:00 &#8211\; 5:00 PM). Don’t leave wit
 hout browsing the marketplace for unique holiday finds. 🛍️ 🎟️ My
 stery Ski Lift Ticket: Every dining guest on Saturdays and Sundays receive
 s a Mystery Ski Lift Ticket at the end of their meal. Prizes include retai
 l discounts\, complimentary tastings\, dining deals\, and a chance to be o
 ur daily $50 gift card winner. Check out our other Après-Ski events on ou
 r website! Nov 20\, 2026\, 11:00am to Jan 3\, 2027\, 5:00pm Timezone: East
 ern Time (US &amp\; Canada)\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/ev
 ent/apr%c3%a8s-ski-holiday-pop-up-at-newport-vineyards/112655/
LOCATION:Newport Vineyards\, 909 East Main Rd. (Rte 138)\, 909 E Main Rd. 
 (Rte 138)\, Middletown\, 02842
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/apr%c3%a8s-ski-holiday-pop-up-a
 t-newport-vineyards/112655/
END:VEVENT
