BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Annual Holiday Stroll on Block Island
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTSTAMP:20261124T205212Z
UID:aeada7400655d58d4665f5b5075c@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Although it's quiet in town compared to the common summer scen
 e\, there are shops\, restaurants\, and hotels that are still open. The Ho
 liday Stroll is a Block Island tradition happening again this year! From F
 riday\, November 27th through Sunday\, Nov. 29th\, enjoy a weekend on Bloc
 k Island\, in tune with a more relaxed-pace instead of the hustle and bust
 le of Black Friday on the mainland. The Shopping Stroll kicks off the holi
 day season with the town adorned in festive decorations including the now-
 famous Lobster Pot Tree\, and local shops offering incredible sales beginn
 ing on Friday morning! For more info on how to turn Black Friday into Bloc
 k Friday stay tuned to this space.: (Shop days and hours may vary\, so mak
 e sure to check)! There will be Traditional and High Speed ferry service f
 rom Pt.Judith over this weekend! For schedule information see here: https:
 //www.blockislandferry.com/schedules-fares/pt-judith-hi-speed-schedule\n\n
 Source: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/annual-holiday-stroll-on-bl
 ock-island/112689/
LOCATION:Across Block Island \, RI 02807 Across Block Island \, RI 02807 O
