 ot talking snowman\, hourly performances (dance studios\, bands\, choirs\,
  entertainers\, or puppet shows)\, and seasonal crafts/activities. Extra R
 ides &amp\; Treats (Cash Only): Rides on the miniature train\, horse-drawn
